248 0 obj
<<
/Title (Security and governance in low-code applications deal with controlling who can use an application, what each person is permitted to do, and how the data and resources of the application are administered. Because low-code platforms make it easy to build applications that store business data, controlling access to that data is an important part of application design. This is especially true for an admissions application, which holds personal details, marks and documents of applicants.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 182 0 R
/Next 318 0 R
>>
endobj
