/Title (Zoho Creator provides built-in mechanisms for this purpose. User permissions define the operations that a user may perform on the components of an application. Role-based access places users in roles that are arranged in a hierarchy, which influences the records that they can see. Data sharing rules extend the visibility of records from one role or user to another with a defined level of access. Administrative controls allow the application to be configured and)
