383 0 obj
<<
/Title (Read permission allows a user to view the components and records of the application without changing them, whereas Write permission allows the user to make changes, such as adding or modifying records. Admission_Officer_Access is a permission profile named for the admission officers of the institution; it is listed alongside the Read and Write profiles and can be assigned to users who process student applications.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 252 0 R
/Prev 324 0 R
/Next 325 0 R
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Roles tab shows the role hierarchy of the application. In the Student Admission application the hierarchy is displayed with Principal at the top, Admissions Head below it and Department Coordinator below that. The options Expand All, Collapse All, Manage Role Hierarchy and Add Role are available.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 325 0 R
>>
endobj
