388 0 obj
<<
/Title (The three options are Roles, Roles and Subordinates, and Users. Roles shares the records of a single selected role, Roles and Subordinates shares the records of a role together with the roles beneath it in the hierarchy, and Users shares the records of selected individual users. In this experiment Roles was selected, with the Admissions Head role as the source. With Read Only access, members of the Department Coordinator role can view the shared records of the Student Admission form but cannot modify them.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 253 0 R
/Prev 387 0 R
/Next 328 0 R
>>
endobj
